From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chelovechishee <261262090+chelovechishee@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 23/43] ASoC: samsung: abox: log DSP component registration

Components arrive by IPC from the DSP firmware; with ABOX kept on, only
"PCM ext" is reported at boot.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 sound/soc/samsung/abox/abox.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/samsung/abox/abox.c b/sound/soc/samsung/abox/abox.c
index add86554c..ef167f045 100644
--- a/sound/soc/samsung/abox/abox.c
+++ b/sound/soc/samsung/abox/abox.c
@@ -4425,6 +4425,7 @@ static int __abox_register_component_work_func(struct device *dev,
 		return -EAGAIN;
 
 	component->registered = true;
+	dev_info(dev, "%s: %u controls\n", desc->name, desc->control_count);
 	for (i = 0; i < desc->control_count; i++) {
 		struct ABOX_COMPONENT_CONTROL *control = &desc->controls[i];
 		struct abox_component_kcontrol_value *value;
@@ -4481,7 +4482,7 @@ static int abox_register_component(struct device *dev,
 	struct abox_data *data = dev_get_drvdata(dev);
 	struct abox_component *component;
 
-	dev_dbg(dev, "%s(%d, %s)\n", __func__, desc->id, desc->name);
+	dev_info(dev, "%s(%d, %s)\n", __func__, desc->id, desc->name);
 
 	for (component = data->components;
 			((component - data->components) <
